    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Ne... que = only",
     "texto": [
      "With **ne... que** you say «only»: **Je ne bois que de l'eau** (I only drink water).",
      "Watch out: **que** goes right in front of the word it limits."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Seulement, uniquement",
     "texto": [
      "**Seulement** and **uniquement** also mean «only»: **Je mange seulement le matin** (I only eat in the morning). All three forms are correct; the choice depends on the sentence and the register."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
